   0.40  0.0625  0.4444  0
   0.50  0.1406  0.2500  0
   0.60  0.2500  0.1111  0
   0.70  0.3906  0.0278  0
   0.80  0.5625  0.0000  0
   1.00  1.0000  0.0000  0 /

-- SPE1 gas/oil curves, cut at the maximum gas saturation 1 - 0.2 = 0.8; krog reaches zero at
-- Sg = 0.7 so that the critical oil saturation in the gas/oil system is 0.1, not 0.
SGOF
   0.00  0.000  1.000   0
   0.02  0.000  0.997   0
   0.05  0.005  0.980   0
   0.12  0.025  0.700   0
   0.20  0.075  0.350   0
   0.30  0.190  0.090   0
   0.40  0.410  0.021   0
   0.50  0.720  0.001   0
   0.60  0.870  0.0001  0
   0.70  0.940  0.000   0
   0.80  0.960  0.000   0 /

